OL,3,GNEWSAMan missing in flooding discarded
OL,4,Aby police, family say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grieving father says he felt his son
OL,7,Fwas "discarded" by police after he went
OL,8,Fmissing in floodwater.
OL,10,FAlan Hirst, 19, was cycling home to
OL,11,FAdforton, Herefordshire, in February
OL,12,Fwhen it is believed he fell from his
OL,13,Fbike on the flooded A4110 and suffered
OL,14,Fa cardiac arrest when he entered the
OL,15,Fwater.
OL,17,FHis family have raised concerns about
OL,18,Fthe police search, with his father
OL,19,FSteve telling the BBC: "It was like he
OL,20,Fwas just discarded."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
